{"id":"NCT07479433","title":"The NAVIGATE-PCI Registry: A New Approach to VIew CT-derived Guidance Ahead of Stenting To Plan Efficient PCI","official":"The NAVIGATE-PCI Registry: A New Approach to VIew CT-derived Guidance Ahead of Stenting To Plan Efficient PCI","summary":"The objective of Heartflow's NAVIGATE-PCI Registry is to collect observational data about the management of patients before and after deployment of Heartflow's PCI Navigator.","conditions":["Coronary Artery Disease (CAD)"],"interventions":[{"type":"DIAGNOSTIC_TEST","name":"Heartflow PCI Navigator"}],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria (all must be present):\n\n1. CCTA completed ≤90 days prior to elective PCI with acceptable image quality according to Heartflow's image quality requirements\n2. Referred for elective PCI\n3. Clinically stable without symptoms suggestive of acute coronary syndrome (ACS) at the time of the intervention\n\nExclusion Criteria (all must be present):\n\n1. ED presentation (at the time of the referral for PCI)\n2. Previous coronary artery bypass graft (CABG)\n3. Planned intervention in a previously stented vessel territory\n4. Acute chest pain (in patients who have not been ruled out for ACS)\n5. Participating in a conflicting study being undertaken during the PCI","minAge":"18 Years","maxAge":"","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"OBSERVATIONAL","purpose":"","enrollment":5000,"start":"2026-03-11","pcd":"2026-08-23","upd":"2026-11-12","sponsor":"HeartFlow, Inc.","areas":["other"],"central":["Abby Doctolero · 650-241-1221 · adoctolero@heartflow.com","Sarah Mullen · 650-241-1221 · smullen@heartflow.com"],"sites":[{"f":"Stanford Medical Center","city":"Palo Alto","pr":"California","zip":"94304","s":"R","lat":37.4419,"lon":-122.143,"c":"Juyong Brian Kim, MD · 650-721-7119 · kimjb@stanford.edu"},{"f":"University of Miami","city":"Miami","pr":"Florida","zip":"33136","s":"R","lat":25.7743,"lon":-80.1937,"c":"Yiannis Chatzizisis, MD · 305-243-4950 · ychatzizisis@med.miami.edu"},{"f